<title>FRANCE: EU raises daily wheat flour refund.</title>
<headline>EU raises daily wheat flour refund.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday raised the daily refund applying to exports of wheat flour to 10 Ecus per tonne from a previous nine Ecus, EU grain officials said.</p>
<p>The decision was taken at weekly cereals management committee talks in Brussels.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
